  "limitations": [
    "This is the synchronous choice sub-interface, not a complete decision environment. Existing NnPolicy enumerates a main-action superset, not a certified legal mask. No main-action stepping or every-decision training samples yet.",
    "Inline/zero/singleton choices can bypass callbacks. Forecast is synchronous; no async suspension/resume/stale-response protocol. OfferedCard does not label deck/develop/forecast because existing hook lacks that metadata.",
    "Host must monitorFaults and abort/reject erroneous episodes; NNTrain productiondump remains unchanged and does not yet record adapter-specific faults. No claim of integrated neural policy or complete RL pipeline.",
    "Actor observations reuse existing745dim pooled encoder; this test does not certify complete information visibility,Intel/revealed-card handling,hidden counters or sufficient Markov state. Offered candidates are engine-supplied,not independently proven PvP-visible here.",
    "Snapshot values/read-only collections prevent leaking mutable enginecards through the request. Hostdelegate can still capture arbitrary external references; this is not an OS/security sandbox. Policies must be synchronous,non-reentrant and pure.",
    "100paired first-index runs are behavioral-preservation checks only,not rule fidelity or AI strength. Prior3QueenOwnlong episodes remain rejected; no winner/policy changes. Worker semantic labels from truncated excerpts are not adopted."
  ],
